VERDICT: fix
- The inline script contains a syntax error — `function ledIteration(nets, catNet, extra Stamp) { ... }` — so the whole script block fails to parse/execute, no wires are drawn, and `window.__sim` is never defined (hence "Unexpected identifier 'Stamp'" and "window.__sim.state() is missing or failed"). Deleting the unused stub fixes it.

